In terms of actual damage done, your best choice is either Mojo or Frosty,
depending on enchantment.  Since Frosty is a doubling weapon, the enchantment
to it is doubled.  Thus, a +8 long sword named Frost Brand does a bit more
damage than a +8 war hammer named Mjollnir.  But +0 Mojo is better than +0
Frosty.  The actual point at which the damages coincide is around +2 to +5,
depending on size of target.  I computed it once, but don't recall it at the
moment.

The unicorn horn is indispensable, but I usually don't use it as a weapon.

Excalibur is essential if you aren't using Stormy, since those are the only
two items which protect you from level drain.


